  "body": "Closes #5910.\n\nDecision record settling the three §1.4 presentation surfaces named by parent #5688: human-readable export, hand-authored upload, and agent-authored statements.\n\n## What it decides\n\n- **One pipeline, three front doors.** Every write surface enters the shared parse → canonical JSON → decompose → resolve pipeline at stage 1. No write surface may enter at stage 3 or later — the concrete form of the parent's \"no agent-only back door\".\n- **Export is a read-only derived rendering** from the retained canonical JSON anchor to KDL. It preserves the authored statement boundary and does not recompose triples heuristically.\n- **Hand upload** is one authored compound statement with an author identity; errors are actionable for non-developers (line/column, construct, fix).\n- **Agent statements** use the same upload path with a required provenance stamp recorded on the canonical JSON anchor, not authorable as KDL.\n- **Trust is one policy stage on the author**, after validation — untrusted humans and untrusted agents take the same staging route. Staging is a state of a submission, not a second store.\n- **Round trip:** only #5906's canonical-JSON → KDL → canonical-JSON Tier A guarantee is claimed. Store-level reimport identity and triple→KDL reconstruction are left to #5907, since #5906 calls the content hash an identity *candidate*.\n\n## Deferred (named, with defaults)\n\nDecomposition rules (#5907), payload boundary (#5908), annotation syntax (#5753), revision linkage of edited exports, and cross-statement re-composition.\n\n## Verification\n\nDocs-only: one new file, no code touched. Baseline `origin/main` at `cc09dd4f5f`; confirmed no KDL parser/validator/ingest code exists in `pkgs/id` at that baseline.\n\n🤖 Generated with [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai)\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796759734&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7797&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7797&signature=a81bafc899a058d287575dd665e4ffd558c3c7489a302e7b74362e26266064cc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7797?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
